# The repository root is never a container build context: it holds .git, local .env files
# and keys that must not reach a build (Laysi/trustiot#120). Image builds use their own
# directory or a generated directory as the context (docs/architecture/secrets.md).
# podman reads this file too when there is no .containerignore.
# scripts/ci/check-secret-handling.ts keeps "*" as the first pattern.
*
